# Vanilla-only fallback stat sheet (no plugin required). Opened with:
#   /trigger rpgcore.menu
# Clicking a [+] spends a stat point via the matching trigger objective, which
# player/tick.mcfunction picks up and forwards to stats/alloc_*.mcfunction.
#
# Bedrock/Geyser note: Bedrock clients cannot click chat components, so every
# [+] button is also printed as a plain command the player can type. Text is
# kept ASCII-safe (no emoji / special glyphs) so it renders on both platforms.
# Bedrock players get a much nicer native form via the companion plugin's
# /stats command instead.
